        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.6.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 6.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.8.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ore enkaraki, ee enkaraki naitapong'oitie iltung'ana laainei, ejo, ‘Eseriani,’ ina kata meetae eseriani; te nkaraki, ina kata nashet iltung'ana esuntai, nepuonu iloibonok aamur te nturoto; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tiaaki lelo oibonok oomur te nturoto kesulari ninye! Ekelotu olairrag le nchan, o isoito le nchan oodou nelotu olkutati kitok oleng; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore peyie esulari esuntai, aimejokini intae, ‘Koree apa emurata nitumurie ninye?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa nji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Ekaitaa olkutati kitok opuku losiwuo metigila te ngoro ai; naa ketumi oloirrag le nchan te ngoro ai, o enchan sapuk te ngoro napi naidaikie ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kagil auroo ina suntai nitumurakita enturoto nauroo ninye te nkop, metaa ore olkitamanyunoto lenye neirrag metii toki; ore tenesulari, terishata enye; niyiolouu aajo ara nanu Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku neijia aiko tenaitayu engoro ai te ina suntai, o te lelo ootumura ninye te nturoto; naa kaajoki iyie, meekure eetae ina suntai, arashu lelo ootumura ninye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore lelo oibonok le Israel lelo ooibonoki Yerusalem nedol induaat eseriani te nkaraki ninye, ina kata meetae eseriani ejo Olaitoriani Enkai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore iyie nakerai e tung'ani, intorioki enkomom ino tigilunore nena toyie oo ltung'ana linono, nena naaibonisho too ndamunot enye maate; imbonoki tigilunore ninche ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tiaki, inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Ekake ayia nena kituaak naeniki nkaik enye pooki intasimi, naaitobiraki entoki naitoipie ilukuny iltung'ana pooki, irreshoo iltauja! Irreshoo iltauja loo ltung'ana laainei, ninchosho ilkulikae tauja etoni aaisho tenkaraki dupoto inyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisarkionie nanu tiatua olorere lai te mborei e nkaina e shairi o te mbelati emukate, iariara metuata iltung'ana lemeishaakino neye ninchosho iltung'ana lemeishaakino neishu etoni eishu, te lejare inyi ilejileje iltung'ana laainei, lelo ooinining'u elejare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Neaku nji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Ing'ura kagilunore nena tasimi inyi nirreshieshie iltauja, naa kapolosu aiwuang'ie too nkaik inyi; naa kaisho lelo tauja litarresho epuo etalaayioki anaa imotonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore sii nena nintoipiepie ate naa kapolos aiwuang'ie, naitajeu iltung'ana laainei aitung'uaa nkaik inyi, nemeitoki aekata aatii nkaik inyi anaa eng'ues naibung'aki aanya; niyiolouu ina kata aajo ara nanu Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu itaara iltauja loo supati te monkoi, hoo neitu nanu aar ninye oltau, nintagolo ilo torrono, nemeibelekenya ninye aing'uaa enkoitoi enye e ntorroni pee eitajeu enkishui enye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neaku meekure aekata intokiki aadol induaat olmilo anaa iasishorere ntasimi; ekaitajeu iltung'ana laainei aitung'uaa nkaik inyi. Niyiolouu ina kata aajo ara nanu Olaitoriani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
